{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（14日）上午7時15分，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其4個月大男嬰倒臥在天水圍天頌苑頌浩閣一單位的床上，沒有呼吸及反應。救援人員接報到場，男嬰陷入昏迷，由救護車送往天水圍醫院搶救，惟最終證實不治。警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是天水圍天頌苑。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142757702112776192469071.jpeg/4FspZxvqwF2-oeo-zEuWbV1MpZC0HH7OuHb1yp129co\"/><figcaption>現場是天水圍天頌苑。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到醫院調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142757699591868416748035.jpeg/vqrEgvSX6rFCtAx3fXhNWIJpPK9h3ueH0yHrN_Yh6zc\"/><figcaption>警員到醫院調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"刑事調查隊人員在醫院調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142758051007172608809465.jpeg/NOKgrrbuSOYzovrfQb_jKIqB7gIoV9V8bGDP0Elgz9A\"/><figcaption>刑事調查隊人員在醫院調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到醫院調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142757697280675840951702.jpeg/jYqq7vdP58v96hE8VuAMGkP39mjy5Sktx1rmpOJa5qQ\"/><figcaption>警員到醫院調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主被送往天水圍醫院搶救。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142757694596190208079638.jpeg/OkRHU2ZuBf3I-ny_ao7N6yYpM1ppBJXQhSSuDaAkrg0\"/><figcaption>事主被送往天水圍醫院搶救。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-14T05:13:37.530882+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}